repository-code: "https://github.com/BenFrohman/frohmanian-tether-sdiff"
abstract: "Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of conditional statements about the Frohmanian tether, a symmetric quadratic correction to the Arnold Lie-Poisson bracket: (C3) unconditionally, (C1) and (C2) under named hypotheses, canonicity in a restricted class, and an obstruction to damping (T(M,H) = 0 for every functional M under (C2)). Analytic results are implications from open hypotheses. Not a proof of Navier-Stokes global regularity; no Clay Millennium claim."
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - Navier-Stokes
  - Lie-Poisson bracket
  - metriplectic
  - conditional results
